@act_saxony_organise
title: Build factory cells and recruit
subtitle: −1 resources · dev: org +5×m
view-if: x_saxony_organise = 1
choose-if: c_saxony_organise = 1
unavailable-subtitle: [? if d_saxony_cd > 0 : We acted here this turn. ?][? if d_saxony_cd <= 0 : Needs 1 resource. ?]
on-arrival: {! window.KPD.act(Q, 'saxony', 'organise'); !}
new-page: true

= Build factory cells and recruit

Organisers go from works gate to works gate in Saxony. New cells meet in back rooms after the shift. The dues book fills slowly, and so does the list of names the police would like to have.

{!<div class="kpd-insert" data-insert="district" data-arg="saxony"></div>!}

- @root: Continue.

@act_saxony_struggle
title: Lead a strike or an unemployed march
subtitle: dev: org +2×m, pressure +6, strikes +1, workers_kpd +1×m, kf_left_strength +1
view-if: x_saxony_struggle = 1
choose-if: c_saxony_struggle = 1
unavailable-subtitle: [? if d_saxony_cd > 0 : We acted here this turn. ?][? if d_saxony_cd <= 0 : Needs at least a thin organisation here. ?]
on-arrival: {! window.KPD.act(Q, 'saxony', 'struggle'); !}
new-page: true

= Lead a strike or an unemployed march

In Saxony the party calls the workers out: a strike over the wage the inflation ate this week, a march of the unemployed to the town hall. The employers answer with lockouts and the police with batons, and the workers see who stood with them.

{!<div class="kpd-insert" data-insert="district" data-arg="saxony"></div>!}

- @root: Continue.

