view-if: x_saxony_front = 1
choose-if: c_saxony_front = 1
unavailable-subtitle: [? if d_saxony_cd > 0 : We acted here this turn. ?][? if d_saxony_cd <= 0 : Needs 1 resource and at least a weak organisation here. ?]
on-arrival: {! window.KPD.act(Q, 'saxony', 'front'); !}
new-page: true

= Build the united front with SPD and union workers

In Saxony our cells go to the SPD and union branches with a concrete proposal, not a lecture: a joint meeting, a joint demand, a joint committee. Some branch secretaries refuse. Some of their members come anyway.

{!<div class="kpd-insert" data-insert="district" data-arg="saxony"></div>!}

- @root: Continue.

