new-page: true

= Form a unit of the Proletarian Hundreds

A new unit of the Proletarian Hundreds forms in Saxony: workers from the same works, drilling at night with what weapons they have. Today they protect meetings. What they will be asked to do tomorrow is a question the party has not yet answered.

{!<div class="kpd-insert" data-insert="district" data-arg="saxony"></div>!}

- @root: Continue.

@act_saxony_control
title: Set up price control committees
subtitle: dev: org +3×m, pressure +3, workers_kpd +1×m, unemployed_kpd +1×m
view-if: x_saxony_control = 1
choose-if: c_saxony_control = 1
unavailable-subtitle: [? if d_saxony_cd > 0 : We acted here this turn. ?][? if d_saxony_cd <= 0 : Needs at least a solid organisation here. ?]
on-arrival: {! window.KPD.act(Q, 'saxony', 'control'); !}
new-page: true

= Set up price control committees

Control committees of workers and housewives go to the markets of Saxony, check prices and hoards, and post the names of the profiteers. The police call it vigilantism. The queues call it the first sensible thing anyone has done.

{!<div class="kpd-insert" data-insert="district" data-arg="saxony"></div>!}

- @root: Continue.

@act_saxony_mayday
